    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Anne: Are there many people in your family?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "Li：不多。我们家有四个人。我的爸爸、妈妈、哥哥和我。",
      "traditional": "Li：不多。我們家有四個人。我的爸爸、媽媽、哥哥和我。",
      "pinyin": "bù duō wǒ men jiā yǒu sì ge rén wǒ de bà ba mā ma gē ge hé wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li: Not many. My family has four people. My dad, mom, big brother, and I."
    },
