      "simplified": "Li：是的。我也有一个哥哥。",
      "traditional": "Li：是的。我也有一個哥哥。",
      "pinyin": "shì de wǒ yě yǒu yí ge gē ge",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li: That’s right. I also have a big brother."
    },
